-- examples/checks/agg-sum-budget.rofl — agg_sum_budget: the budget cuts the
-- evaluation of agg-budget-data.rofl while ab_r is still being derived, and
-- the sum of the weights into a node over it is no answer: the cut is a hole on the world and the
-- aggregate has no row at all.
-- expect-row: hole[$kernel]($adhoc,budget_exhausted)
-- expect-no-row: abb_s[main](
abb_s(C, S) :- ab_node(C), S is sum(W ; A : ab_r(A, C, W)).
